    "dataProcessingProtocol": "Data evaluation was performed with PEAKS X pro software using 15 ppm for precursor mass tolerance, 0.5 Da for fragment mass tolerance, specific tryptic digest and a maximum of 3 missed cleavages. DCP (+168.08 Da), DCP-BIO (+394.16 Da), DCP-ac (+196.08 Da) on cysteine residues and NBF (+163.00 Da) on cysteine, lysine and arginine residues were added as variable modification. Peptide-spectrum match (PSM) and protein were filtered at 1% FDR.",
